  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "escaping the winter cold; wintering in a warm place",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "escaping the winter cold; spending winter in a warm place",
      "explanation": "Leaving a cold region to spend the winter somewhere milder, or avoiding the worst of the cold. The winter counterpart of {避暑|ひしょ} (escaping the summer heat)."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "29344_hikan_ex1",
      "japanese": "{沖縄|おきなわ}へ{避寒|ひかん}に{行|い}く。",
      "english": "to go to Okinawa to escape the cold",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29344_hikan_ex2",
      "japanese": "{祖父|そふ}は{毎年|まいとし}{暖|あたた}かい{地方|ちほう}で{避寒|ひかん}する。",
      "english": "My grandfather spends every winter in a warm region.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29344_hikan_ex3",
      "japanese": "{冬|ふゆ}の{間|あいだ}だけ{南国|なんごく}のホテルに{滞在|たいざい}して{避寒|ひかん}する{人|ひと}もいる。",
      "english": "Some people stay at a hotel in the tropics for the winter just to escape the cold.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The winter counterpart of {避暑|ひしょ} (escaping the summer heat). Refers to leaving a cold area to spend the winter somewhere milder.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {避寒|ひかん}{地|ち}: winter resort; place for escaping the cold\n- {避寒|ひかん}に{出|で}かける: to go away to escape the cold\n- {避寒|ひかん}{旅行|りょこう}: a trip to escape the winter cold\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {避暑|ひしょ}: escaping the summer heat — the summer counterpart",
